  "details": "As mentioned in the title im getting the infinite space screen with nothing appearing or happening. I have tried both VR and non-VR verisons of the game and the following fixes\n\nI have tried:\n\nClearing cache\n\nRemoving the Temp VRChat folder\n\nReinstalling\n\nVerifying game files on steam\n\nThe |cmd /k \"del %TEMP%\\VRChat /q /f /s\"| command fix from the Tupper on the Steam forum\n\nRenaming the .../AppData/LocalLow/VRChat' folder to 'VRChat_bak' and reinstalling VRChat.\n\nAnd also combinations of all of the above.\n\n\nAt this point im all out of options and honestly getting a bit desperate. So if anyone has anything that could be a potential fix for the issue I would love you could help me.",
